<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15763" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cake</i> or <i>loaf of
				wheat-bread,</i> mostly in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.120
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος οὖλος</span> a
			whole <i>loaf,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				17.343
			</span></i>; collectively, <i>bread,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δούλιον ἄρτον ἔδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					2.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. τρισκοπάνιστος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					35
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζα</span>
			(<i>porridge</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				37
			</span></i>.—Freq. in all writers. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρτος: βόλος τις, καὶ ὁ Ἀθηναίων
				ξένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
